穿云 core muse.15: REALITY keeps the post-quantum X25519MLKEM768 key share.
Servers updated from Sep 2026 refuse a REALITY hello without it; servers that
do not know the group just pick X25519. The auth key still comes from the plain
X25519 share (or the X25519 half of the hybrid share when there is no plain one).

